    "body": "Previously, any error happening when communicating with Redis would be considered as \"Record already exists\", even if there was a Redis error (like server went down, storage failure, etc).\r\n\r\nThis fix allows the real error to be propagated and sends the client an HTTP 500 error with context instead of a valid response with an empty UUID.",
